{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Postmarks》是一款將日常步行轉化為環球旅行的創新 App，今天限時免費中，它適合所有希望為運動增添樂趣、培養步行習慣的使用者。無論你是想讓每天的散步更有目標，還是渴望透過輕鬆方式記錄生活中的移動軌跡，這款應用都能將你的每一步化為充滿意義的旅程，讓你邊走邊收集世界各地的獨特郵票，體驗前所未有的樂趣。</p>\n\n<h2>足跡化為郵票探索世界新方式</h2>\n<p>它將你的每一步化為前進的動力，帶你穿越東京街頭與京都古寺等全球名城，沿途收集獨特的復古郵票，並填滿專屬的旅行護照。這些郵票代表真實的成就，你的步行紀錄也將自動生成精美日誌，幫助你自然而然地養成健康的步行習慣。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-129-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-130-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-131-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-132-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-133-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-134-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Postmarks 終生版內購限時免費中，名額５００位，要使用 App Store 兌換連結下載，額滿即止。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Postmarks: Gamified Walking</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-21T03:58:59.753647+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":408,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}